{
  "about": "Account situations of packaging/experience_run.py. A scenario is an account set, the usage every window starts the day at, and the user's own switches. Add a scenario by adding an entry. accounts: name (the sign-in slot: claude, claude-2, codex, codex-2, opencode), family (claude | codex | opencode) and plan (a plan of references/plan-templates.json; opencode has none). usage: a usage_states name for every account; usage_by_account names one per account. switches: outside_allowed (accounts taken out of host-policy allowed_accounts after setup), unchecked ({account, model}: every bundle of that model on that account unchecked in model management), plan_ends ({account, in_hours, basis}: `agentcompass override --expires-in`). days: how many working days the stream is played (nights are skipped on the simulated clock).",
  "usage_states": {
    "about": "Each state gives [used percent, share of the period already elapsed] for the short windows (under 24 h) and the long ones, at the first hour of the day.",
    "fresh": {"short": [0, 0.0], "long": [0, 0.0]},
    "mid_period": {"short": [25, 0.4], "long": [50, 0.5]},
    "nearly_empty": {"short": [70, 0.4], "long": [93, 0.6]},
    "short_empty": {"short": [100, 0.5], "long": [30, 0.3]},
    "scarce": {"short": [90, 0.3], "long": [96, 0.7]},
    "late_period_unused": {"short": [5, 0.2], "long": [20, 0.9]}
  },
